-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-500 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-amber-400 font-semibold tracking-wide\" aria-current=\"page\">About</span></nav><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-3 mb-5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-700/50 backdrop-blur-md\"><div class=\"w-6 h-0.5 bg-amber-500 rounded-full\"></div><span class=\"text-[11px] sm:text-xs tracking-widest uppercase font-semibold text-amber-400\">ABOUT THE INSTITUTE</span></div><h1 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-serif font-light text-white tracking-wide max-w-3xl mb-6 leading-[1.15] drop-shadow-md\">An International Home for Qur&#x27;anic Scholarship</h1><p class=\"text-slate-200 text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg max-w-2xl mb-10 font-light leading-relaxed drop-shadow-sm\">A premier academic and research institution advancing excellence in Tafsir al-Qur&#x27;an, Qur&#x27;anic Sciences and interdisciplinary Islamic research.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\"><a class=\"group bg-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-600 active:bg-emerald-800 text-white px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium flex items-center gap-2.5 shadow-lg shadow-emerald-950/40 hover:shadow-emerald-900/50 transition-all duration-200 transform hover:-translate-y-0.5\" href=\"/governance\"><span>Our Governance</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-4 h-4 text-emerald-200 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"group border border-slate-300/60 hover:border-white bg-slate-900/50 hover:bg-slate-800/70 active:bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 hover:text-white px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium flex items-center gap-2.5 backdrop-blur-md transition-all duration-200 transform hover:-translate-y-0.5\" href=\"/research\"><span>Research</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-4 h-4 text-slate-300 group-hover:text-white group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-all\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"border-b bg-slate-100 border-slate-200 py-10\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><div class=\"text-center md:border-r border-slate-300\"><p class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif text-slate-700 font-light mb-1\">08</p><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-500 tracking-wider uppercase\">ACADEMIC DEPARTMENTS</p></div><div class=\"text-center md:border-r border-slate-300\"><p class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif text-slate-700 font-light mb-1\">10</p><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-500 tracking-wider uppercase\">RESEARCH DOMAINS</p></div><div class=\"text-center md:border-r border-slate-300\"><p class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif text-slate-700 font-light mb-1\">06</p><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-500 tracking-wider uppercase\">PUBLISHING STREAMS</p></div><div class=\"text-center \"><p class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif text-slate-700 font-light mb-1\">25</p><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-500 tracking-wider uppercase\">SCHOLARS &amp; OFFICE HOLDERS</p></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\"><div class=\"relative h-95 md:h-115 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-slate-200\"><img alt=\"Executive Overview Desktop\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"hidden md:block object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Foverview-mosque.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Foverview-mosque.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Foverview-mosque.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Foverview-mosque.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Foverview-mosque.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Foverview-mosque.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Foverview-mosque.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Foverview-mosque.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Foverview-mosque.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><img alt=\"Executive Overview Mobile\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"block md:hidden object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Foverview-mosque.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Foverview-mosque.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Foverview-mosque.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Foverview-mosque.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Foverview-mosque.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Foverview-mosque.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Foverview-mosque.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Foverview-mosque.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Foverview-mosque.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-8 h-0.5 bg-emerald-600\"></div><span class=\"text-xs tracking-widest uppercase font-semibold text-emerald-700\">EXECUTIVE OVERVIEW</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-6 leading-snug\">Scholarship, Integrity and Global Collaboration</h2><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4\">The International Research Institute for Tafsir al-Qur&#x27;an (IRITAQ) is a premier international academic and research institution established under the auspices of Al-Jamia Al-Jalaliyya in Kerala, India. As a flagship initiative of the Syed Muhammad Ali Shihab Thangal Research Consortium, the Institute is dedicated to advancing excellence in Tafsir al-Qur&#x27;an, Qur&#x27;anic Sciences and interdisciplinary Islamic research through rigorous scholarship, academic integrity and global collaboration.</p><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8\">IRITAQ serves as an international platform for research, scholarly dialogue, academic publications and institutional partnerships, while integrating the rich heritage of classical Islamic scholarship with contemporary research methodologies and emerging technologies.</p><a class=\"bg-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-800 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-full text-sm font-medium inline-flex items-center gap-2 transition\" href=\"/departments\">Academic Departments<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-right w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 bg-slate-100\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-8 h-0.5 bg-emerald-600\"></div><span class=\"text-xs tracking-widest uppercase font-semibold text-emerald-700\">FOUNDING VISION</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-6 leading-snug\">A Legacy That Continues to Guide Us</h2><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4\">The establishment of IRITAQ is inspired by the visionary legacy of Shams al-Ulama Sheikh Abu Bakr Musliyar, whose lifelong dedication to Qur&#x27;anic scholarship, authentic Islamic education and intellectual excellence continues to inspire generations.</p><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">The Institute also honours the enduring legacy of Sayyid Muhammad Ali Shihab Thangal, whose exemplary leadership, moral integrity, educational vision and lifelong service to Islam and humanity remain the guiding spirit of this institution.</p></div><div class=\"relative h-95 md:h-115 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-slate-200\"><img alt=\"Founding Vision Desktop\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"hidden md:block object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ffounding-legacy.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffounding-legacy.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffounding-legacy.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffounding-legacy.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffounding-legacy.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffounding-legacy.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffounding-legacy.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffounding-legacy.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ffounding-legacy.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><img alt=\"Founding Vision Mobile\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"block md:hidden object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ffounding-legacy.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffounding-legacy.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffounding-legacy.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffounding-legacy.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffounding-legacy.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffounding-legacy.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffounding-legacy.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Ffounding-legacy.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ffounding-legacy.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-2\"><div class=\"w-8 h-0.5 bg-amber-700\"></div><span class=\"text-xs tracking-widest uppercase font-medium text-amber-700\">VISION &amp; MISSION</span><div class=\"w-8 h-0.5 bg-amber-700\"></div></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl text-black md:text-4xl font-serif\">Purpose That Anchors Every Programme</h2></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"border border-slate-700/10 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-amber-700/30\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-serif text-amber-700 mb-4\">Our Vision</h3><p class=\"text-black text-sm leading-relaxed\">To become a globally recognized centre of excellence and an authoritative reference in Tafsir al-Qur&#x27;an and Qur&#x27;anic Studies through academic leadership, pioneering research and international collaboration.</p></div><div class=\"border border-slate-700/10 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-amber-700/30\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-serif text-amber-700 mb-4\">Our Mission</h3><p class=\"text-black text-sm leading-relaxed\">To advance authentic Qur&#x27;anic scholarship through innovative research, academic excellence, international cooperation, scholarly publications and advanced educational programs, while preparing future generations of researchers dedicated to serving the Holy Qur&#x27;an and humanity.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6\"><div class=\"mb-12\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><div class=\"w-8 h-0.5 bg-emerald-600\"></div><span class=\"text-xs tracking-widest uppercase font-semibold text-emerald-700\">CORE VALUES</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-2\">The Principles Behind Our Research</h2><p class=\"text-slate-500 text-sm\">Every project approved and published by the Institute is measured against these commitments.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden divide-y md:divide-y-0 md:divide-x divide-slate-200\"><div class=\"p-8 bg-white hover:bg-slate-50/80 transition\"><span class=\"text-amber-600 font-serif text-lg font-light block mb-2\">01</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-2\">Academic Excellence</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed\">Rigorous scholarship measured against international research standards.</p></div><div class=\"p-8 bg-white hover:bg-slate-50/80 transition\"><span class=\"text-amber-600 font-serif text-lg font-light block mb-2\">02</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-2\">Authenticity</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed\">Grounded in the classical heritage and methodology of Islamic scholarship.</p></div><div class=\"p-8 bg-white hover:bg-slate-50/80 transition\"><span class=\"text-amber-600 font-serif text-lg font-light block mb-2\">03</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-2\">Integrity</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed\">Transparent governance, ethical research and honest scholarly practice.</p></div><div class=\"p-8 bg-white hover:bg-slate-50/80 transition\"><span class=\"text-amber-600 font-serif text-lg font-light block mb-2\">04</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-2\">Innovation</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed\">Emerging technologies applied thoughtfully to Qur&#x27;anic research.</p></div><div class=\"p-8 bg-white hover:bg-slate-50/80 transition\"><span class=\"text-amber-600 font-serif text-lg font-light block mb-2\">05</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-2\">Intellectual Responsibility</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed\">Scholarship that serves the community with clarity and care.</p></div><div class=\"p-8 bg-white hover:bg-slate-50/80 transition\"><span class=\"text-amber-600 font-serif text-lg font-light block mb-2\">06</span><h3 class=\"text-xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-2\">Global Collaboration</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed\">Partnership with universities and research centres worldwide.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 bg-slate-100\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 items-center\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><div class=\"w-8 h-0.5 bg-emerald-600\"></div><span class=\"text-xs tracking-widest uppercase font-semibold text-emerald-700\">INSTITUTIONAL PROFILE</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-serif text-slate-800\">Specialised, International, Interdisciplinary</h2></div><div class=\"md:col-span-2 space-y-4 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\"><p>IRITAQ is an international research institute specializing in Tafsir al-Qur&#x27;an, Qur&#x27;anic Sciences, Qira&#x27;at, Qur&#x27;anic manuscripts, linguistic studies and interdisciplinary Islamic research.</p><p>The Institute collaborates with universities, scholars and research organizations worldwide through academic partnerships, conferences, publications and research initiatives aimed at strengthening global Qur&#x27;anic scholarship.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6\"><div class=\"mb-12\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\"><div class=\"w-8 h-0.5 bg-emerald-600\"></div><span class=\"text-xs tracking-widest uppercase font-semibold text-emerald-700\">HISTORY &amp; OBJECTIVES</span></div><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-2\">How the Institute Came to Be</h2><p class=\"text-slate-500 text-sm\">From its founding under Al-Jamia Al-Jalaliyya to its strategic objectives for the years ahead.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\"><div class=\"space-y-8 relative pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-300\"><div class=\"relative\"><span class=\"absolute -left-7.75 top-1.5 w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-amber-500 border-2 border-white\"></span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-wider text-emerald-700 uppercase block mb-1\">FOUNDATION</span><h3 class=\"text-lg font-serif text-slate-800 mb-1\">Established under Al-Jamia Al-Jalaliyya</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed\">The International Research Institute for Tafsir al-Qur&#x27;an was established under the auspices of Al-Jamia Al-Jalaliyya as a pioneering initiative of the Syed Muhammad Ali Shihab Thangal Research Consortium.</p></div><div class=\"relative\"><span class=\"absolute -left-7.75 top-1.5 w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-amber-500 border-2 border-white\"></span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-wider text-emerald-700 uppercase block mb-1\">MANDATE</span><h3 class=\"text-lg font-serif text-slate-800 mb-1\">A global platform for advanced Tafsir research</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed\">The Institute was founded to provide a global academic platform for advanced research in Tafsir al-Qur&#x27;an, preserving the rich heritage of classical Islamic scholarship.</p></div><div class=\"relative\"><span class=\"absolute -left-7.75 top-1.5 w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-amber-500 border-2 border-white\"></span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-wider text-emerald-700 uppercase block mb-1\">DIRECTION</span><h3 class=\"text-lg font-serif text-slate-800 mb-1\">Answering contemporary intellectual challenges</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed\">Addressing contemporary intellectual and academic challenges through innovative research, publications and international cooperation.</p></div><div class=\"relative\"><span class=\"absolute -left-7.75 top-1.5 w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-amber-500 border-2 border-white\"></span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-wider text-emerald-700 uppercase block mb-1\">OBJECTIVES</span><h3 class=\"text-lg font-serif text-slate-800 mb-1\">Strategic objectives for the decade ahead</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-xs leading-relaxed\">Cultivating distinguished researchers, developing advanced research programs, publishing high quality scholarly works, establishing strategic partnerships with leading universities, and utilizing emerging technologies including Artificial Intelligence.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative h-95 md:h-120 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-slate-200\"><img alt=\"History Mosque Desktop\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"hidden md:block object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fhistory-mosque.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhistory-mosque.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhistory-mosque.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhistory-mosque.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhistory-mosque.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhistory-mosque.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhistory-mosque.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhistory-mosque.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fhistory-mosque.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><img alt=\"History Mosque Mobile\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"block md:hidden object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fhistory-mosque.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhistory-mosque.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhistory-mosque.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhistory-mosque.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhistory-mosque.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhistory-mosque.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhistory-mosque.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fhistory-mosque.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fhistory-mosque.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"w-full bg-[#111613] text-[#cfd4cf] font-sans border-t border-[#1e2520]\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-16 pt-16 pb-12\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-12 pb-14 border-b border-[#1e2520]\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-1 space-y-5\"><div class=\"relative w-36 h-14\"><img alt=\"IRITAQ Logo\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain brightness-0 invert\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo-iritaq.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo-iritaq.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo-iritaq.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo-iritaq.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo-iritaq.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo-iritaq.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo-iritaq.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Flogo-iritaq.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Flogo-iritaq.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><h2 class=\"text-white font-serif font-light text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight\">International Research Institute for Tafsir Al-Qur&#x27;an</h2><p class=\"text-xs text-[#9da39d] font-light leading-relaxed\">Advancing authentic Qur&#x27;anic scholarship through research, publication and international collaboration.</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 pt-2\"><a href=\"https://facebook.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-white hover:bg-slate-200 flex items-center justify-center text-slate-950 transition shadow-xs