m leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":\"The International Research Institute for Tafsir al-Qur'an (IRITAQ) is a premier international academic and research institution established under the auspices of Al-Jamia Al-Jalaliyya in Kerala, India. As a flagship initiative of the Syed Muhammad Ali Shihab Thangal Research Consortium, the Institute is dedicated to advancing excellence in Tafsir al-Qur'an, Qur'anic Sciences and interdisciplinary Islamic research through rigorous scholarship, academic integrity and global collaboration.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8\",\"children\":\"IRITAQ serves as an international platform for research, scholarly dialogue, academic publications and institutional partnerships, while integrating the rich heritage of classical Islamic scholarship with contemporary research methodologies and emerging technologies.\"}],[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"href\":\"/departments\",\"className\":\"bg-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-800 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-full text-sm font-medium inline-flex items-center gap-2 transition\",\"children\":[\"Academic Departments\",\" \",[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"icon\":\"$b:props:children:0:props:children:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:icon\",\"className\":\"w-4 h-4\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"py-20 bg-slate-100\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-8 h-0.5 bg-emerald-600\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs tracking-widest uppercase font-semibold text-emerald-700\",\"children\":\"FOUNDING VISION\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif text-slate-800 mb-6 leading-snug\",\"children\":\"A Legacy That Continues to Guide Us\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4\",\"children\":\"The establishment of IRITAQ is inspired by the visionary legacy of Shams al-Ulama Sheikh Abu Bakr Musliyar, whose lifelong dedication to Qur'anic scholarship, authentic Islamic education and intellectual excellence continues to inspire generations.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"The Institute also honours the enduring legacy of Sayyid Muhammad Ali Shihab Thangal, whose exemplary leadership, moral integrity, educational vision and lifelong service to Islam and humanity remain the guiding spirit of this institution.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative h-95 md:h-115 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-slate-200\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L17\",null,{\"src\":\"/founding-legacy.png\",\"alt\":\"Founding Vision Desktop\",\"fill\":true,\"className\":\"hidden md:block object-cover\"}],[\"$\",\"$L17\",null,{\"src\":\"/founding-legacy.png\",\"alt\":\"Founding Vision Mobile\",\"fill\":true,\"className\":\"block md:hidden object-cover\"}]]}]]}]}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"py-20 text-white\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-center mb-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-8 h-0.5 bg-amber-700\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs tracking-widest uppercase font-medium text-amber-700\",\"children\":\"VISION & MISSION\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-8 h-0.5 bg-amber-700\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl text-black md:text-4xl font-serif\",\"children\":\"Purpose That Anchors Every Programme\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\